Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.46,0:00:08.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia tak punya informasi penting\Nkarena cuma bawahan rendahan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.34,0:00:13.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa boleh buat.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita masuk lewat sini, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.07,0:00:21.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Nanti mengarah ke area pembuangan mayat.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.42,0:00:24.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tampaknya mereka menggiling semua mayat,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.74,0:00:27.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu mengalirkan sisanya ke sungai.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.58,0:00:28.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menjijikkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.18,0:00:37.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jenderal, Yaoroshi,\Ndan Umitsuki akan menyerang lantai empat.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.83,0:00:40.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Todomeki mengurus lantai tiga.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Fuwa dan Kakoi pergi ke lantai dua.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.60,0:00:45.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma dan aku membereskan lantai satu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.63,0:00:48.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat bersenang-senang!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.48,0:00:49.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.84,0:00:52.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan memberikan dukungan penuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.60,0:00:53.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.90,0:00:55.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Darah?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.94,0:00:57.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Darahku. Minumlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.43,0:01:02.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sedang apa kalian?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.02,0:01:05.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudahlah, minum saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.10,0:01:08.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa-apaan ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.20,0:01:10.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Perjaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.88,0:01:12.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa suara kami terdengar, Bocah Polos?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.78,0:01:15.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar bocah nakal otak kopong beralis tindik.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.36,0:01:17.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa mendengar suara kalian di kepalaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.27,0:01:20.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau yang barusan mengejekku, ayo mengaku!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.85,0:01:24.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah kemampuanku...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.29,0:01:25.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berbagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.87,0:01:31.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa pun yang meminum darahku\Nbisa bertelepati meski saling berjauhan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.91,0:01:34.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini botol cadangan, untuk jaga-jaga.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.95,0:01:42.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya siap?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.93,0:01:45.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bunuh Momotaro di semua lantai\Nyang kalian datangi!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.58,0:01:48.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamatkan semua tawanan Oni!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.66,0:01:52.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma dan aku akan melakukan penyelidikan,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.75,0:01:54.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi beri tahu kami jika menemukan petunjuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.90,0:01:56.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kupercayakan padamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.39,0:01:57.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.47,0:02:00.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan terus maju hingga lantai teratas
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.24,0:02:03.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan menghabisi semua Momotaro di sana!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.05,0:03:42.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya semua sudah sampai di tujuan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.57,0:03:46.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa melacak lokasi kalian\Ndan memantau kondisi fisik dan mental kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.26,0:03:50.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian bisa membisukan percakapan ini\Nkapan pun kalian mau,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.68,0:03:53.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,tetapi tidak bisa menghalangiku\Nuntuk terhubung dengan kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.32,0:03:55.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menjengkelkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.31,0:04:00.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Secara umum, laboratorium ini dibagi menjadi\Nlantai umum, tempat kalian saat ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.93,0:04:02.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan area penelitian.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.59,0:04:06.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertama, pergilah ke pintu-pintu\Nyang mengarah ke area penelitian.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.39,0:04:09.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pandu kami, Kyotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.93,0:04:11.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.10,0:04:15.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lurus ke ujung lorong itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.07,0:04:17.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lurus ke depan!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.34,0:04:20.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan! Kenapa kau berbelok?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.57,0:04:21.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.31,0:04:23.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada empat prajurit.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.60,0:04:26.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku yang mengurus mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teknikmu memiliki batas jumlah penggunaan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.88,0:04:31.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Simpan untuk saat benar-benar diperlukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.47,0:04:32.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku yang akan menanganinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.48,0:04:33.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.00,0:04:36.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Jenderal yang turun tangan,\Nbisa-bisa area ini berlumuran darah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.73,0:04:46.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ubur-ubur?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.51,0:04:50.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bosan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.49,0:04:52.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemampuan kita bisa tumpul.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.73,0:04:56.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin membunuh Oni\Ndan melampiaskan amarahku.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.77,0:04:58.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.56,0:05:08.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teknik Gerhana Darah:
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ubur-ubur Bergelembung.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.29,0:05:12.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Laki-laki dilarang memandangiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.79,0:05:17.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ubur-ubur putih ciptaan Miyo\Nbersifat sangat lengket.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekali mereka menempel,\Nsulit sekali melepaskannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.41,0:05:23.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian para pria, jangan menatapku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.95,0:05:26.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia kasar sekali padamu, Yaoroshi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.66,0:05:29.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga lelaki, Jenderal.\NJangan memandangiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.64,0:05:31.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar tak punya wibawa.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.42,0:05:41.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada orang di depan sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.78,0:05:43.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku yang menangani musuh selanjutnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.82,0:05:45.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi, sudah kubilang.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.76,0:05:48.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tujuanku kemari bukan main-main!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.31,0:05:50.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Senjata apa yang tercipta\Ndari amarahku hari ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.15,0:05:55.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teknik Gerhana Darah:
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.06,0:05:56.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Histeria Terkutuk!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.83,0:06:08.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.73,0:06:13.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,O-Oni?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.23,0:06:18.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha? Kalian siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.24,0:06:20.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan bergerak.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.45,0:06:21.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bergerak berarti mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.00,0:06:37.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kuulangi sekali lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.88,0:06:39.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bergerak berarti mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.76,0:06:42.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jawab pertanyaanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.68,0:06:44.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang sedang kalian teliti di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.89,0:06:46.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana para Oni yang kalian tangkap?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.43,0:06:48.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ti-Tidak tahu!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.18,0:06:52.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemampuan kami lemah.\NTugas kami cuma memasak.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.19,0:06:55.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cih. Cuma koki rupanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.19,0:06:57.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita ikat saja mereka dan pergi dari sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.98,0:07:03.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, matilah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.28,0:07:25.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kumohon! Tolong aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.57,0:07:33.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku baru bergabung dengan Agensi Momotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.60,0:07:36.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku belum pernah membunuh Oni!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.27,0:07:38.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tugasku di sini cuma memasak!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.69,0:07:42.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, kumohon, ampuni aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.12,0:07:54.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.88,0:08:00.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia cuma koki, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lantas?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.38,0:08:08.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selama dia Momotaro, dia adalah sasaran.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.84,0:08:10.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jenderal, kita bisa masuk lewat sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.97,0:08:11.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.13,0:08:26.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jumlahnya lebih sedikit dari perkiraanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.28,0:08:29.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang sudah larut.\NMungkin semua orang sedang tidur?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.91,0:08:32.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau mereka ada di area selanjutnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.66,0:08:37.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini lantai dua.\NKami sudah sampai di depan pintu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.79,0:08:40.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke. Apakah yang lain sudah sampai?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.92,0:08:43.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini Torikai.\NHirunuma dan aku sudah berada di posisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Todomeki sudah sampai!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.96,0:08:47.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.98,0:08:50.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita serang bersama-sama!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengerti.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.37,0:08:54.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, serahkan padaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.69,0:09:01.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemampuan Shinichi adalah Asam.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.94,0:09:04.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua yang tersentuh darahnya akan larut.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.16,0:09:12.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cukup lebar untuk dilewati.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.45,0:09:15.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lantai satu, beres.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di sini juga sudah beres.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.43,0:09:18.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maju!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.40,0:09:25.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terdeteksi entitas tak dikenal!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.03,0:09:28.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terdeteksi entitas tak dikenal!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.53,0:09:30.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seluruh personel, bersiap siaga!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terdeteksi kemungkinan adanya penyusup!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.43,0:09:34.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diulangi, alarm telah berbunyi!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.10,0:09:36.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terdeteksi kemungkinan adanya penyusup!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Periksa sektor masing-masing!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.73,0:09:42.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ketua! Ada keadaan darurat!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.48,0:09:44.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.61,0:09:46.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selesaikan saja sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.69,0:09:47.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.71,0:09:51.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sedang asyik bermain rumah-rumahan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.74,0:09:53.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bermain... apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.51,0:09:55.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lihat ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.20,0:09:56.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jantung berdenyut yang indah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.00,0:09:59.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jantung tak kenal lelah ini ibunya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.96,0:10:02.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan bola mata itu ayahnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.46,0:10:08.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waduh! Anak nakal mereka, si Perut,\Nsedang memacu sepeda motornya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.51,0:10:12.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Brum, brum!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.60,0:10:15.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Ayo! Maju! Aku akan melesat seperti angin!"
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.10,0:10:18.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Anak itu selalu saja bertingkah!"
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.73,0:10:21.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Brum, brum!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.24,0:10:24.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Diam! Aku tak mau patuh pada Ibu!"
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.65,0:10:27.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Brum, brum!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.04,0:10:29.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ketua, semoga ini cuma peringatan palsu,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.03,0:10:32.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi jika memang ada penyusup,\Nkita punya masalah serius.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.41,0:10:33.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan memeriksanya sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.25,0:10:35.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, tunggu dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.91,0:10:38.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin mereka sudah memasang jebakan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.54,0:10:39.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan ada yang bergerak!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.82,0:10:42.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Periksa dengan cermat apakah ada jebakan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.87,0:10:46.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kapten, kau terlalu waspada.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.37,0:10:49.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita pasti akan baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.51,0:10:51.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak perlu sampai sebegitunya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.89,0:10:53.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar bodoh!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.78,0:10:55.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ibarat menyeberang jembatan,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.44,0:10:58.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,sebaiknya periksa dulu umur jembatan itu\Ndan seberapa parah kerusakannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.08,0:10:59.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah cara terbaik!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.78,0:11:01.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal tinggal lewat saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.76,0:11:02.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bego!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.79,0:11:05.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana jika ruangan ini sudah dijebak?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.57,0:11:07.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.82,0:11:09.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melangkahlah dengan hati-hati!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.82,0:11:15.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Ayah Bola Mata,\Nsudah waktunya menghadapi putramu."
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.75,0:11:17.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Kau benar, Ibu."
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.66,0:11:18.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah dia baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.70,0:11:21.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Tak ada yang bisa menghentikanku!"
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya, Ketua.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.12,0:11:24.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.14,0:11:27.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejauh mana kami boleh menghancurkan\Nlaboratorium ini tanpa menimbulkan masalah?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.84,0:11:31.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hancurkan semaumu,\Nselama lantai atas dan atap tetap utuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.31,0:11:32.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.34,0:11:34.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kapten, bisa jalan saja, tidak?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.33,0:11:41.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu mereka! Penyusup!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.81,0:11:44.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka datang bergerombol!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.07,0:11:47.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Justru mereka datang terlambat.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.36,0:11:50.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar sekali.\NToh nantinya mereka pasti menemukan kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.02,0:11:52.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bunuh mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.34,0:11:55.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian semua, habisi Momotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.09,0:11:56.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu selamatkan Oni!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.49,0:11:59.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satu hal lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan sampai mati!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.67,0:12:02.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Siap!\N- Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.01,0:12:17.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penyusup! Tangkap mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hajar mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.15,0:12:32.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lintah kecil dan berlendir?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.91,0:12:39.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebaiknya jangan coba-coba melewatinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.91,0:12:45.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini cuma trik murahan untuk menghambat kita!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.28,0:12:46.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maju terus!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.12,0:12:59.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.55,0:13:01.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei! Jawab aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.60,0:13:02.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lintah itu mengeluarkan racun.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.63,0:13:08.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berani menyeberang, berarti nyawa melayang.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.16,0:13:13.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma Akari memberikan darahnya\Npada lintah yang hidup di dalam tubuhnya,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.41,0:13:16.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu menggunakannya sebagai sarana\Nuntuk mengendalikan darahnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.24,0:13:19.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lintahnya memiliki berbagai\Nsifat selain racun.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.93,0:13:25.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan begini, kita masih punya waktu\Nuntuk melakukan penyelidikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.84,0:13:27.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mantap, Hirunuma!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.40,0:13:35.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya ruangan ini tidak digunakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.72,0:13:39.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau berpencar untuk mencari petunjuk?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.97,0:13:44.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar lintahku membantu kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.94,0:13:50.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, ya, kalian kusuruh mencari petunjuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.48,0:13:58.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma, memangnya kau paham\Nucapan para lintahmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.99,0:14:02.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, tetapi aku paham ekspresi mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.03,0:14:06.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah. Hubungan kalian luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.75,0:14:12.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sungguh kasihan pada mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.61,0:14:15.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kuseret mereka hidup dalam peperangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.36,0:14:18.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makanya aku berjanji pada mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.64,0:14:21.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Janji? Janji apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.66,0:14:22.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bersama para lintah ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.02,0:14:28.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Torikai.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.52,0:14:31.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ambil ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.15,0:14:34.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Flashdisk?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.32,0:14:39.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kita menganalisisnya, kita mungkin\Nakan mengetahui penelitian mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.65,0:14:43.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Peralatannya masih ditinggalkan di sini,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.12,0:14:45.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,jadi pasti ada komputer yang masih berfungsi\Ndi suatu tempat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.66,0:14:49.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Torikai! Kita diserang!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.33,0:14:53.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.55,0:15:04.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Torikai? Hirunuma?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.06,0:15:09.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ledakannya dahsyat.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.30,0:15:10.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan sampai lengah!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.06,0:15:13.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski di hadapanmu ada mayat!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.58,0:15:19.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kewaspadaan sejati berarti membunuh musuh\Nsebelum mereka sempat melihatmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.57,0:15:22.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kumo! Kalau ingin panjang umur, ingatlah ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.03,0:15:25.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kau merasa tak enak badan,\Npergilah ke rumah sakit.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.72,0:15:28.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski lampunya hijau, lihat ke kanan-kiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.33,0:15:31.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tindakan waspada membuahkan hasil terbaik.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.58,0:15:36.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu pula dalam situasi ini,\Njangan lupakan sentuhan akhir.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.42,0:15:42.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemusnahan selesai!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.09,0:15:46.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah, ayo kita musnahkan\Npara penyusup yang lain!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.35,0:15:50.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di lantai ini mungkin cuma ada mereka,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.53,0:15:52.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,jadi, ayo kita ke lantai atas.\NMerepotkan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.55,0:15:57.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kapten...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.32,0:16:05.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Membuat duplikat diri dari lintah\Nsaat itu juga, hebat.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.16,0:16:11.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa berkonsentrasi berkat\Nperlindungan sayap burungmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.43,0:16:16.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan meremehkan Brigade Oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.35,0:16:20.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berani-beraninya kalian menganggap kami hama.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.63,0:16:27.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemusnahan selesai!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.39,0:16:35.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kini kita paham kemampuan dasar mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.35,0:16:38.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kubilang, Kumo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.13,0:16:41.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tindakan waspada membuahkan hasil terbaik!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.99,0:16:47.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seperti Hirunuma, dia menggandakan diri\Nuntuk mencari tahu kemampuan kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.82,0:16:49.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia lihai.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.91,0:16:52.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ralat. Kami bertemu dengan kapten\Ndan wakil kapten Momotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.95,0:16:54.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat ini kami sedang menghadapi mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.66,0:16:58.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma, lawan si wakil kapten.\NAku yang akan menangani si kapten.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.75,0:17:00.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita pisahkan dulu mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.42,0:17:02.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.56,0:17:04.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awas!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.38,0:17:11.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia terdiam,\Nlalu tiba-tiba berteriak, "Siap?"
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.43,0:17:12.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah itu isyarat untuk menjebak?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.54,0:17:14.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.06,0:17:16.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kumo? Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.08,0:17:17.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa yang melakukan ini padamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.31,0:17:19.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau, Kapten.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.44,0:17:20.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurang ajar!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.46,0:17:22.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jebakan musuh? Tak bisa dimaafkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.69,0:17:25.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Izinkan aku memukulmu nanti.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.57,0:17:27.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa mereka ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.57,0:17:29.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan lengah.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.30,0:17:31.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tsunami Lintah.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.59,0:17:45.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka berniat memisahkan kami?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.34,0:17:47.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semoga berhasil.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.59,0:17:49.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita harus bertemu lagi hidup-hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.85,0:17:54.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.78,0:17:59.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akulah lawanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.02,0:18:12.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia sudah tak sabar untuk bertarung.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, mari bertarung di tempatku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tempat apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.38,0:18:27.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lubang-lubang menyeramkan ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.63,0:18:28.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,gua?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.01,0:18:33.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setiap kapten di laboratorium ini\Nmendapat ruangan pribadi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.04,0:18:37.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini ruanganku sebagai Kapten Unit 1.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.27,0:18:39.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.98,0:18:43.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,kalau kutaruh rak, bisa saja roboh.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.77,0:18:45.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau ada ranjang, aku bisa bangun kesiangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.73,0:18:49.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ini orangnya sangat berhati-hati.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.18,0:18:54.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah menimbang semua "kemungkinan",\Nruangan ini jadi kosong melompong.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.74,0:18:57.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.87,0:19:00.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,kuputuskan bahwa ruangan yang kosong\Ndapat menumpulkan kewaspadaanku,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.50,0:19:03.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,makanya kuminta Ketua merenovasinya!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.30,0:19:12.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.14,0:19:18.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.11,0:19:32.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mobil mewah?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.41,0:19:34.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepeda!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.03,0:19:36.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ngok!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.08,0:19:37.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seekor... Seekor babi?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.23,0:19:39.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Si Babi?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.47,0:19:41.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau melihat si Babi?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.04,0:19:43.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Langka sekali! Kau beruntung!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.23,0:19:44.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diamlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.63,0:19:46.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengesankan, bukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.21,0:19:47.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menyebutnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.34,0:19:51.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ruangan "Waspada,\NSesuatu Bisa Muncul Tiba-Tiba!"
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.55,0:19:53.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Payah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.01,0:19:57.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sulit untuk bertarung di sini, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.72,0:20:00.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, aku sudah terbiasa di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.06,0:20:04.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah kau yang baru saja tertabrak?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.94,0:20:09.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.48,0:20:12.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kebiasaan sering kali menimbulkan kelalaian.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.44,0:20:14.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tetap waspada, Shingi!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.33,0:20:15.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa dengan si dungu ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.95,0:20:17.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia membuatku kebingungan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.28,0:20:19.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.99,0:20:22.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan sampai terbawa permainannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.09,0:20:24.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lambat!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.08,0:20:29.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa aku harus menunggu sampai kau\Nselesai membuatnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.80,0:20:31.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak! Tidak perlu!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.75,0:20:35.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Momobayashi Shingi mengubah bakterinya\Nmenjadi berkas cahaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.93,0:20:38.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, dia tak bisa membidiknya dengan tepat,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.03,0:20:41.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,sehingga terpaksa menembakkannya\Nke sembarang arah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.56,0:20:43.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurang ajar!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.73,0:20:49.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Celaka!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.86,0:20:58.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagi Oni sepertiku,\Nserangannya tidak terlalu melukai,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.47,0:21:00.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi aku benar-benar jadi tak bisa fokus.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.05,0:21:06.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahaya kalau jumlahnya sebanyak itu!\NAku harus menciptakan burung!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.27,0:21:07.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lambat!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.13,0:21:16.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat seranganmu baru dimulai,\Nseranganku sudah berakhir.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.63,0:21:18.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ngok, ngok!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.97,0:21:20.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.89,0:21:24.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Si Babi?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.64,0:21:27.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.48,0:21:28.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia mungkin bodoh.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.31,0:21:30.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Langka sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.33,0:21:31.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ngok!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.77,0:21:34.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi dia luar biasa tangguh!
